=== Even-ones DFA, as if statements ===
  ''        -> True
  '1'       -> False
  '11'      -> True
  '1011'    -> False
  '0000'    -> True
  '10101'   -> False
  'abc'     -> False

=== Trace of '1011' ===
  start: even
  '1' -> odd
  '0' -> odd
  '1' -> even
  '1' -> odd
  final: odd -> REJECT

=== At-least-3-consecutive-a's DFA, as if statements ===
  'aaa'     -> True
  'baaab'   -> True
  'aaaa'    -> True
  'aabaa'   -> False
  'ababab'  -> False
  'aa'      -> False
  ''        -> False
